{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "latam", "appid": 548430, "month": "2022-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1642982400, "end_date": 1643673599, "month_true_total": 22, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:32:24 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "109155482", "author": {"steamid": "76561199113699126", "personaname": "iEmece", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199113699126/", "num_games_owned": 82, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 107319, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 623, "playtime_at_review": 966, "last_played": 1787802179, "avatar": "67e0d8bfd9b39319f6dde65e60e85148e6757cce"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Juegazo.\nPuedes jugarlo con amigos, desconocidos o en solitario y aún así te sentirás bien. El juego es sumamente relajante y entretenido con su estética y variedad de enemigos y misiones.\nRecomendado 100%", "timestamp_created": 1643601707, "timestamp_updated": 1643601707, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109152541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198453066923", "personaname": "IZZEI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IOZAN/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 24515, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14227, "last_played": 1779554411, "avatar": "d84c21a60756feb8a22d2e505af06cf810e147ad"}, "language": "latam", "review": "esta muy bueno el juego las cosas como son", "timestamp_created": 1643597381, "timestamp_updated": 1643597381, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109046304", "author": {"steamid": "76561199156895515", "personaname": "XaXaGOD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199156895515/", "num_games_owned": 477, "num_reviews": 244, "playtime_forever": 4009, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 490, "last_played": 1744616316, "avatar": "cd9dc4d7c22609d659a327e382b43c725af82811"}, "language": "latam", "review": "[h1] Excelente [/h1]\n\nEste juego es brutal, me encanta en todo lo que es el juego. Trata de ir haciendo diferentes tipos de misiones (recoleccion de minerales, huevos alienigenas, etc) mas que nada de minado y exploracion. Lo recomiendo tanto multiplayer (hasta de 4 jugadores) como jugando en solitario ya que este mismo cuenta con la asistencia de un dron que nos ayudara en nuestra aventura, tanto peleando contra los enemigos como minando e iluminando el terreno. \nTambién tiene sus gajes de rol al darnos 4 personajes cada uno con su propio equipamiento y armas, los mismos al igual que el dron pueden ser skileados y asi ir mejorando muchos aspectos importantes en el juego.\nGráficamente esta muy bien con su toque de caricatura y sus iluminación es muy bonita. Realmente son buenos para lo poco que pide en los requisitos.\nTiene también online publico activo y la verdad es una buena experiencia en cuanto a pin siempre esta bastante estable.\n\nContado todo esto espero le den una oportunidad ya que es un juego muy interesante y con un buen de horas para meterle.", "timestamp_created": 1643484980, "timestamp_updated": 1643484980, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.61210256814956665", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108968645", "author": {"steamid": "76561198203296733", "personaname": "Agnes Tachyon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198203296733/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 862, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 609, "last_played": 1757974167, "avatar": "3347685d5b0ffdf9fb2eacdabdcfe12d672d3294"}, "language": "latam", "review": "ta weno compren lo", "timestamp_created": 1643399799, "timestamp_updated": 1643399799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108929131", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088184345", "personaname": "Gilitorico", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Gilberthuz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 294, "last_played": 1686435163, "avatar": "76bb1e676be321f390bbf6e9984fa6f3cb3258ef"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Hay enanos que pican piedra", "timestamp_created": 1643357442, "timestamp_updated": 1643357442, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}